    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nina finds herself once again in the village of her childhood, in order to spend such a long-awaited summer there. However, everything in her grandmother's house seems unfamiliar and strange to her when the girl finds a strange book. It becomes the most important mystery for Nina. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our game you can have a romance not only with a man, but also with one of the spirits of Slavic mythology. You will have to solve many riddles, make very ambiguous choices and change your life to survive this summer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nina is the main character, a naive and sweet girl, on whose behalf all the action in the game takes place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489910/extras/c3e2f825b35591bc43f0d39c1c3ce60a.avif?t=1750241359\" width=300 height=363 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil is one of the most mysterious figures of the novel, whose fate is closely intertwined with the girl's family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489910/extras/fc64397f719286e118f1a3f3b4990e0b.avif?t=1750241359\" width=300 height=330 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ghoul Yakov is a strange young man, whom the girl will have to meet at the beginning of her journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3489910/extras/36994f1b21e6b975695bcec66478248d.avif?t=1750241359\" width=300 height=348 /></span></p>",
